      "message": "I use g-j-f with aosp flags (in lunch\u0027d environment):\ngoogle-java-format --aosp -i --skip-sorting-imports --skip-removing-unused-imports\n\nTo above I also add --lines flag to restrict formatting to only changed set of lines.",
      "parentUuid": "5c3a07a8_43c56224",
