      "message": "Well then I\u0027m sorry but I don\u0027t think AOSP support in your tool is sufficient. The help for --aosp says \"4 spaces indent\", and there are many other points of divergence. In particular, this style here is pretty jarring in AOSP, and I would much prefer you stick to the local style.",
