      "message": "Sorry, that was unfair. Let me rephrase.\n\nI care about consistency, that\u0027s why I point things out. Getting to the point where we use some auto-formatter in our code is a significant amount of work (I estimate it to be many years worth of pointing out style), so we\u0027d need someone who cares enough to make it happen. I am supporting of the idea, but I do not care enough about auto-formatters to be that someone. I\u0027ll be happy to support the project if someone who cares decides to take it on.",
