      "writtenOn": "2019-03-22T06:18:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I did run the benchmarks at some point (don\u0027t have the results handy). \nI will run it again and also add one for multiple interfaces. \nIt could be that based on benchmarks results we may have to make some refactors to reduce number of operations (perhaps what junyu had been suggesting all along).\n\nDo you know if there is a guideline for what\u0027s acceptable in terms of increased cost (I\u0027m assuming that the changes I have will definitely have more overhead compared to previous implementation)?",
